{"id":"u-0e0ec6c4-b7cb-43f6-96c2-0f75c9bce236","src":"community","title":"THE CAPABLE BODY METHOD: Built At Home","author":"Jana Faucette","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/QqoIqp-capable-body-dumbbell-only","desc":"The Capable Body Method exists to help you become stronger, more capable, and more confident in the bodies God has given you.\n\nThis is not about chasing a certain body or earning worth through fitness. It is about learning to see the body as a gift entrusted to us—one worth strengthening, caring for, and stewarding well.\n\nThrough intentional strength training, this program is designed to build the physical capacity needed for real life: to carry, serve, work, play, endure, recover, and show up for the people and purposes God has placed in front of you.\n\nBecause strength is not the end goal. Capacity is.\n\nA capable body gives you more freedom to live fully in the body God created you to have. It allows you to approach parenthood, work, relationships, ministry, aging, and everyday life with greater physical resilience and confidence.\n\nThis is strength training rooted in a bigger purpose:\n\nBuild strength. Steward your body. Live your calling.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-16T00:52:26.884Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Full Body","Legs","Arms & Abs","Legs","Arms & Abs"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Broad Jump","sets":[{"r":3,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hang Clean","sets":[{"r":4,"x":2}]},{"n":"Farmer's Walk (Weighted)","sets":[{"sec":60}]},{"n":"Plank Pull-Through","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Front Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Lunge With Knee Drive","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}],"note":"10 per side"},{"n":"Single Leg Deadlift","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Good Morning","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Jump Squat","sets":[{"sec":30,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Overh